		"Details": "The Ebon Jaguar's Alternative Configuration A is capable of dealing blistering damage at a variety of ranges. For long range, the A uses a pair of ER Large Lasers. At close range, the MechWarrior can switch to an Ultra Autocannon/20 that carries a fair amount of ammunition, along with a Medium Pulse Laser, and three ER Medium Lasers. For anti-infantry work, the Ebon Jaguar carries a pair of Machine Guns as well as a Flamer.  The MechWarrior must carefully shepherd their weapons fire, as the variant carries no additional heat sinks.",
